  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {秘密|ひみつ}を{暴露|ばくろ}する - to expose a secret\n- {真実|しんじつ}を{暴露|ばくろ}する - to reveal the truth\n- {暴露|ばくろ}{本|ぼん} - tell-all book, exposé\n- {暴露|ばくろ}{記事|きじ} - exposé article\n\nUSAGE:\nOften implies sensational or scandalous revelation. Used frequently in media and tabloid contexts.\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {発覚|はっかく} - coming to light (passive discovery)\n- {隠蔽|いんぺい} - concealment (opposite action)\n- {告発|こくはつ} - accusation, disclosure (formal/legal)",
